{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And the grapes of your nezirekh.</b> These are the grapes that grow without toil and without effort, like the after-growth in grain. And a proof for this: 'You shall not reap its after-growth and you shall not gather its nezireha' — and its Aramaic translation is: 'the grapes left unpicked from pruning.'" "<b>A sabbath year it shall be for the land.</b> It is not in your domain in that year."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:06.911833592Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}